# Who is who.
#
# The same person appears under several names and addresses across fifteen
# years of this repository: a university address, a GitHub noreply address,
# a bare username. This file says which belong together, so that git log,
# git shortlog and anything generating a citation see one person per person.
#
# Format:  Proper Name <canonical email>  Other Name <other email>
#
# Note that GitHub's own contributor graph does not read this file. It counts
# by commit email, so to merge two entries there, the person adds the other
# address to their GitHub account under Settings > Emails.

